# **1. Business Overview**

SMB AI Ops is an AI operational services firm that configures and manages Claude-powered workflows for small and medium-sized businesses that lack the technical staff to implement and maintain them. We are not a software company. Our product is the implementation layer — the playbooks, connectors, training, and ongoing management that transform a general-purpose AI tool into a working business process.

| **Core Thesis** The gap Anthropic left open is the last-mile layer. SMBs in regulated or operationally complex niches cannot self-implement AI workflows. We fill that gap with vertical depth, embedded client relationships, and proprietary playbooks built from real deployments. The moat compounds with every client onboarded. |
| --- |

