## **The Discovery Call — Universal Script**

The discovery call is a workflow audit, not a product demo. The goal is to make the operator's operational pain visible and quantifiable before presenting any solution.

| **Step** | **Action** |
| --- | --- |
| Open | Generate something real for their specific business live in the free tool. Let them react before you say anything. |
| Pain inventory | Walk me through a typical week for your admin staff. What takes the most time that feels like it shouldn't require a person? |
| Map and quantify | List every workflow named, estimate hours per week, multiply by staff cost rate. Show them the monthly dollar figure. |
| Introduce the concept | We configure and manage AI workflows for [their vertical]. Our clients typically recover the cost within 60 days in staff time alone. |
| Scope on the call | Which workflows, which tools, which integrations. Name a price range before hanging up. Do not let them leave without a number. |
| Close on a start date | If this makes sense, I'll send you a one-page scope this afternoon and we can start the workflow audit next week. Not a follow-up — a start date. |

