| Pro-to-retainer conversion rate | What rate constitutes proof before launching a fourth vertical? | After 10+ Pro subscribers per vertical — typically Month 2–3 |
| Vertical lead hiring profile | Operator background vs. sales background vs. technical background — which per vertical? | Before vertical leads are hired in Month 1–2 |
| HIPAA BAA posture (dental) | Does dental workflow implementation require formal HIPAA compliance posture, and at what client count does this become material? | Before first dental retainer is signed |
| MSP partnership vs. competition | Partner with existing MSPs for distribution or compete with them for the client relationship? | After first retainer — evaluate based on channel economics |
| Seasonal revenue structure | How do retainer agreements handle northern marine operators and dental practices with summer slowdowns? | At first retainer contract draft |
| Fourth vertical timing | HVAC, landscaping, or professional services — which gets the fourth app, and what triggers it? | When combined retainer MRR exceeds $10,000/mo consistently |
| International expansion | Caribbean marine markets, Canadian dental, UK/Australian property management | Year 2 — after domestic playbooks are documented |

